    "Are you sure you want to change the monitor name from '%@' to '%@'?\n\nThis will modify the firmware and require a device reconnection.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "モニタ名を「%@」から「%@」に変更しますか?\n\nファームウェアが書き換えられ、デバイスの再接続が必要になります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Are you sure you want to proceed with the firmware update? This process cannot be undone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ファームウェアの更新を実行しますか? この処理は取り消せません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
